; Meridian Freight Systems (M8, GDD 8.4, DECISIONS 2026-09-24): 32-Site Grid mirroring Solace's shape
; (home -> ten T1 -> eight T2 with three Exploits -> eight T3 -> The Manifest), four Heat objectives,
; six story paths (Ghost Freight foreshadows DISPATCH, Civic Contract foreshadows Halcyon Civic).

